    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:67604a53ca2280b3dcd59b4972ebb3f3529c0bbe429c65983a6ca6c00a6ebf4f",
      "request_id": "67604a53ca2280b3dcd59b4972ebb3f3529c0bbe429c65983a6ca6c00a6ebf4f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ffd61371cb864d4ce967da60ff1082a7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘二比四，阿卡先追回四比四。接下来的发球局，他还要顶住底线相持，争回领先。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1da7dbd83e61439aed3a2be0311deca3738eee0d54961160d5581ca936daeab0",
      "words_sha256": "ae9da8c9414853023146ae1347775a2fd6556c60b343368f968a87a654fa0cf9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:7ef60ee26ef640e1b3477a2e45a874c18f0f468719b0c0f8c8e6307501b98535",
      "request_id": "7ef60ee26ef640e1b3477a2e45a874c18f0f468719b0c0f8c8e6307501b98535",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2d65f3ffdbfc16621e66ada7d1e0cb5a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "真正的险关是弗里茨。先丢一盘，再救回两个赛点；六比七、七比五、六比三，他把自己留在了签表里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ce808f9aacba4c30a982d19298a057a0c1752e6bd5eddec2f942a5568f032880",
      "words_sha256": "647f9a0580ea7fecce8866ed2a437257b973c1a16410c023bec337251a099e0d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:90133715c72844ae96fc41b6d52cd12471e5fe8de9a0158f095040ea6de90872",
      "request_id": "90133715c72844ae96fc41b6d52cd12471e5fe8de9a0158f095040ea6de90872",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5a43eda5e78201d83e31b78e2d4bdfda",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "首盘抢七，三比四落后。阿卡从底线寻找进攻机会，最后五个小分拿下四个，七比六先赢一盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "81fb05541e9cb88be6d38c2c94384937c797394342a5ac50eacfc71bdb6cd3a8",
      "words_sha256": "47205788d79655a38172a9f60d49c26c17851858e815747c45243abecaf7dba1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:99d2a8ddbd047c351159aa335702a3d15a30a324118a145eb69cd1e1511c01dd",
      "request_id": "99d2a8ddbd047c351159aa335702a3d15a30a324118a145eb69cd1e1511c01dd",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1e3f42b15814a2c2ad8738827f9ab0da",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘接对手二发，十二个小分里阿卡拿下八个。二比四之后，最后六局赢下五局，六比五领先，再到谢尔顿的发球局争冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e5353251b84db1d062e518fc61ea4582628ed2f5148ab09aa96f9955b5bbec33",
      "words_sha256": "2c4e38326ea5e5b82d8e8db8c50b3a7ed8392f78561b634f6f73349ef4247db7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9f87f51f2156df36054a56a834d70cdc6c6307ffe26a07ef728553cbc30263c4",
      "request_id": "9f87f51f2156df36054a56a834d70cdc6c6307ffe26a07ef728553cbc30263c4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d6b6ba1754f30c47c782759f991cca6c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "先用两盘击败米克尔森。第三轮，贝雷蒂尼赛前退赛，阿卡直接晋级四分之一决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5d0cc717c7d2a2b99f8d9c15ab38e980e887f4d4be9c6a46b886a5602e9b115f",
      "words_sha256": "fff3dbbc64af2070236f6d46fb80b131f0ccdfb11b06c9faf6eb9c0d7b0cc0de"
    },
    {
